ParentVault_forceCancelDeposit
├── when the caller does not have the CANCEL_DEPOSIT_OPERATOR_ROLE
│   └── it should revert
└── when the caller has the CANCEL_DEPOSIT_OPERATOR_ROLE
    ├── when the epoch is not open
    │   └── it should revert with ParentVault__EpochNotOpen
    ├── when the user has no deposit
    │   └── it should revert with ParentVault__NoDeposit
    └── when the force cancel is valid
        ├── it should transfer USDC from the vault to the user
        ├── it should delete the user's deposit mapping
        ├── it should update the epoch total deposit amount
        └── it should emit DepositForceCancelled
